   "widgets_values": [
    "default",
    "Write the narration for a faceless YouTube tutorial: how to make a first $1,000 with the Hanzo app builder by building a website or booking page for one local business. Chapters: hook, the system, don't sell AI, find clients, the outreach message, package the offer ($500 / $750 / $1,000), the discovery call, the deposit (50% upfront), build the first draft in Hanzo from a specific prompt, send the draft for feedback, QA and final invoice before handoff, monthly support upsell ($100 / $250 / $500 per month), recap. Plain, confident, no hype. Output only the spoken words, one chapter per paragraph, 1,200 to 1,400 words.",
    "You write narration for screen tutorials. Short sentences. No hedges. Say the outcome, then the step.",
    0.4,
    2400,
    true
   ],
